c=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"350\"/><figcaption>Student.Dept_ID references Department.Dept_ID · Based on DOCX pp. 260–261<\/figcaption><\/figure>","73":"<figure><img alt=\"A worked savepoint example that commits Change A and undoes Change B\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"167\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"340\"/><figcaption>A worked savepoint example that commits Change A and undoes Change B · Based on DOCX p. 264<\/figcaption><\/figure>","76":"<figure><img alt=\"Seven Chen ER symbols, including weak entity, key, multivalued and derived attributes\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"262\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"344\"/><figcaption>Seven Chen ER symbols, including weak entity, key, multivalued and derived attributes · Redrawn from the DOCX p. 265 symbol table<\/figcaption><\/figure>","58":"<figure class=\"efp-reference-table\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Key type<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Rule<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Example<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Super<\/td><td>Any unique identifier<\/td><td>{Roll_No, Name}<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Candidate<\/td><td>Minimal super key<\/td><td>{Roll_No} or {Email}<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Primary<\/td><td>Chosen candidate key<\/td><td>{Roll_No}<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Alternate<\/td><td>Remaining candidate key<\/td><td>{Email}<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Foreign<\/td><td>References a valid key<\/td><td>Student.Dept_ID<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Composite<\/td><td>Two or more key columns<\/td><td>{Student_ID, Course_ID}<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><figcaption>Database keys at a glance<\/figcaption><\/figure>","67":"<figure class=\"efp-reference-table\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Category<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Role<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Common commands<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>DDL<\/td><td>Structure<\/td><td>CREATE, ALTER, DROP, TRUNCATE, RENAME<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>DML<\/td><td>Rows<\/td><td>INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>DQL<\/td><td>Retrieval<\/td><td>SELECT<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>DCL<\/td><td>Permissions<\/td><td>GRANT, REVOKE<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>TCL<\/td><td>Transactions<\/td><td>COMMIT, ROLLBACK, SAVEPOINT<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><figcaption>SQL categories at a glance<\/figcaption><\/figure>"},"14":{"10":"<figure><img alt=\"John McCarthy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"302\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"295\"/><figcaption>John McCarthy · PDF p. 268<\/figcaption><\/figure>","13":"<figure><img alt=\"Data collection through production monitoring and maintenance\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"323\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"330\"/><figcaption>Data collection through production monitoring and maintenance · Redrawn from PDF pp. 268–271<\/figcaption><\/figure>","17":"<figure><img alt=\"Example data split and the distinct purpose of each subset\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"151\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"342\"/><figcaption>Example data split and the distinct purpose of each subset · Based on PDF p. 269<\/figcaption><\/figure>","24":"<figure><img alt=\"The learning signal for supervised, unsupervised and reinforcement learning\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"151\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"346\"/><figcaption>The learning signal for supervised, unsupervised and reinforcement learning · Based on PDF p. 272<\/figcaption><\/figure>","33":"<figure><img alt=\"Image classification returns labels. Object detection also locates objects.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"162\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"339\"/><figcaption>Image classification returns labels. Object detection also locates objects. · Based on PDF p. 274<\/figcaption><\/figure>","48":"<figure><img alt=\"Chapter logos for ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Copilot, Perplexity and Grok\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"264\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"348\"/><figcaption>Chapter logos for ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Copilot, Perplexity and Grok · PDF pp. 275, 277–281<\/figcaption><\/figure>","72":"<figure><img alt=\"IndiaAI Mission logo\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"168\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"342\"/><figcaption>IndiaAI Mission logo · PDF p. 291<\/figcaption><\/figure>","79":"<figure><img alt=\"Three IndiaAI components covered in the chapter and their roles\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"126\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" width=\"339\"/><figcaption>Three IndiaAI components covered in the chapter and their roles · PDF pp. 291–292 and PIB<\/figcaption><\/figure>","68":"<figure class=\"efp-reference-table\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Sector<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Uses<\/th><th scope=\"col\">Examples<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Healthcare<\/td><td>Diagnostics, surgical assistance<\/td><td>Image review, robotic surgery<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Finance<\/td><td>Fraud detection, robo-advisory<\/td><td>Transaction screening, credit risk<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Manufacturing<\/td><td>Predictive maintenance, quality control<\/td><td>Inspection camera, fault alerts<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Retail<\/td><td>Recommendations, inventory<\/td><td>Product suggestions, demand forecast<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Agriculture<\/td><td>Precision farming, disease detection<\/td><td>Drone and satellite imagery<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Energy<\/td><td>Smart grids, predictive maintenance<\/td><td>Load forecasts, renewable forecasts<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Education<\/td><td>Personalized learning, grading support<\/td><td>Language practice, tutoring<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Transport<\/td><td>Driving assistance, route optimization<\/td><td>Road-object detection, map routing<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><figcaption>AI applications across sectors · Original chapter reference table<\/figcaption><\/figure>"}}
</script>

<script>
'use strict';
const MASTER = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('master-data').textContent);
const VISUALS = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('visual-data').textContent);
const SUBJECT_META = {
    'Computer': { icon:'💻', desc:'Fundamentals se IndiaAI tak — 14 Chapters · 145 Sections', color:'from-amber-700 to-yellow-600' }
};
const STORAGE_PREFIX='efp_computer_ch';
const BOOKMARK_KEY='efp_computer_complete_bookmarks_v1';
const LAST_KEY='efp_computer_complete_last_chapter_v1';
const SUBJECT='Computer';
const CHAPTERS=Object.keys(MASTER[SUBJECT]);
const TOTAL=CHAPTERS.reduce((n,ch)=>n+MASTER[SUBJECT][ch].reduce((sum,sec)=>sum+sec.questions.length,0),0);
const state={screen:'home', subject:null, chapterName:null, quizData:null,currentSection:0,score:{correct:0,wrong:0,attempted:0},shuffleMap:Object.create(null)};
let storedAnswers=Object.create(null);
let bookmarks=readLocal(BOOKMARK_KEY,{});
if(!bookmarks || typeof bookmarks!=='object' || Array.isArray(bookmarks)) bookmarks={};
let bookmarkReturn=null;
let bookmarkedOnly=false;
function readLocal(key,other){try { const s=localStorage.getItem(key);return s===null?other:JSON.parse(s); }catch(_){return other;}}
function saveLocal(key,val){try {localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(val));}catch(_){}}
function numOf(ch){const v=/^(\d+)\./.exec(ch);return v?Number(v[1]):0;}
function chapterCode(ch){return String(numOf(ch)).padStart(2,'0');}
function keyOf(ch){return STORAGE_PREFIX+chapterCode(ch)+'_quiz_progress_v1';}
function chapterQCount(sections){return sections.reduce((sum,s)=>sum+s.questions.length,0);}
function subjectQCount(s){return Object.values(MASTER[s]).reduce((n,a)=>n+chapterQCount(a),0);}
function chapterDisplayName(fullName){return fullName.replace(/^\d+\.\s*/, '');}
function chapterNum(fullName){return numOf(fullName);}
function textHTML(v){
    // Preserve intentional source <u> etc., without swallowing literal < comparisons.
    return String(v??'').replace(/<(?!\/?(?:u|b|i|sup|sub|em|strong|br)\s*\/?>)/gi,'&lt;').replace(/\r?\n/g,'<br>');
}
function calcAnswerIndex(q){return q.o.findIndex(o=>o.en===q.a.en);}
function progressFor(ch){
    const p=readLocal(keyOf(ch),null);
    if(!p||p.version!==1||typeof p.answers!=='object'||!p.answers)return {attempted:0,section:0};
    const sections=MASTER[SUBJECT][ch];let attempted=0;
    for(let si=0;si<sections.length;si++)for(let qi=0;qi<sections[si].questions.length;qi++){
        const v=p.answers[`${si}-${qi}`];if(Number.isInteger(v)&&v>=0&&v<4) attempted++;
    }
    return {attempted,section:Number.isInteger(p.section)?p.section:0};
}
function loadProgress(ch){
    const sections=MASTER[SUBJECT][ch], p=readLocal(keyOf(ch),null);
    storedAnswers=Object.create(null);state.shuffleMap=Object.create(null);state.currentSection=0;
    if(p&&p.version===1){
      if(p.answers&&typeof p.answers==='object')for(let si=0;si<sections.length;si++)for(let qi=0;qi<sections[si].questions.length;qi++){
        const k=`${si}-${qi}`,v=p.answers[k];if(Number.isInteger(v)&&v>=0&&v<4)storedAnswers[k]=v;
      }
      if(p.orders&&typeof p.orders==='object')for(const [k,ord] of Object.entries(p.orders)){
        if(Array.isArray(ord)&&ord.length===4&&new Set(ord).size===4&&ord.every(x=>Number.isInteger(x)&&x>=0&&x<4))state.shuffleMap[k]=ord;
      }
      if(Number.isInteger(p.section)&&p.section>=0&&p.section<sections.length)state.currentSection=p.section;
    }
    updateComputedScore();
}
function saveProgress(){
    if(state.screen!=='quiz'||!state.chapterName)return;
    saveLocal(keyOf(state.chapterName),{version:1,section:state.currentSection,answers:storedAnswers,orders:state.shuffleMap});
    saveLocal(LAST_KEY,state.chapterName);
}
function updateComputedScore(){
    let correct=0,wrong=0,attempted=0;
    if(state.quizData)state.quizData.forEach((sec,si)=>sec.questions.forEach((q,qi)=>{
        const k=`${si}-${qi}`;if(!Object.hasOwn(storedAnswers,k))return;
        attempted++;
        if(storedAnswers[k]===calcAnswerIndex(q))correct++;else wrong++;
    }));
    state.score={correct,wrong,attempted};
}
function activeBookmarkKey(q){return `${chapterCode(state.chapterName)}:${q.num}`;}
function renderHome(){
    const subjects=Object.keys(MASTER);
    const last=readLocal(LAST_KEY,null);
    const resume=CHAPTERS.includes(last)?last:null;
    return `
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pt-10 fade-in">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="seal">EF</div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold" style="color:var(--ink)">Computer Complete Practice</h1>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base" style="color:var(--deep2)">कंप्यूटर पूर्ण अभ्यास — 14 Chapters · ${TOTAL.toLocaleString('en-IN')} Questions</p>
        <p class="text-xs mt-1 text-gray-500">SSC · Railway · BPSC · BSSC exam preparation — offline practice</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      ${subjects.map(s=>`
        <div onclick="goToChapters()" role="button" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')goToChapters()" class="card-hover cursor-pointer rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg bg-white border border-gray-200">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br ${SUBJECT_META[s].color} p-6 text-white">
            <div class="text-4xl mb-2">${SUBJECT_META[s].icon}</div><div class="text-xl font-bold">${s}</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5"><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">${SUBJECT_META[s].desc}</p>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-2xl font-bold" style="color:var(--gold)">${subjectQCount(s).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-500">questions</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>`).join('')}
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
        ${resume?`<button onclick="goToQuizByNumber(${numOf(resume)})" class="efp-soft-action">↪ Resume: Chapter ${numOf(resume)}</button>`:''}
        <button onclick="goBookmarks()" class="efp-soft-action">☆ Saved Questions (${Object.keys(bookmarks).filter(k=>bookmarks[k]).length})</button>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mt-10 text-xs text-gray-400">examfusionprep.com &middot; works fully offline once loaded</div>
    </div>`;
}
function renderChapters(){
    return `
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-6 fade-in">
      <button onclick="goHome()" class="mb-4 text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50" style="color:var(--deep)">&larr; All Subjects</button>
      <div class="mb-6"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold" style="color:var(--ink)">Computer</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">${SUBJECT_META.Computer.desc}</p></div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        ${CHAPTERS.map((ch,i)=>{
         const p=progressFor(ch),n=chapterQCount(MASTER[SUBJECT][ch]);return `
            <div onclick="goToQuizByNumber(${i+1})" role="button" tabindex="0" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')goToQuizByNumber(${i+1})" class="card-hover cursor-pointer bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 shadow p-4 flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white flex-shrink-0" style="background:var(--gold)">${chapterNum(ch)}</div>
              <div class="min-w-0"><div class="font-semibold text-sm" style="color:var(--ink)">${textHTML(chapterDisplayName(ch))}</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5">${n} questions &middot; ${MASTER[SUBJECT][ch].length} sections</div>
              ${p.attempted>0?`<div class="efp-small-progress">Progress: ${p.attempted}/${n} (${Math.round(p.attempted/n*100)}%)</div>`:''}
              </div>
            </div>`;
        }).join('')}
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mt-6"><button onclick="goBookmarks()" class="efp-soft-action">☆ Saved Questions</button></div>
    </div>`;
}
function renderQuiz(){
    const sections=state.quizData,sec=sections[state.currentSection];
    return `
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-3 pt-4 fade-in">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 flex-wrap gap-2">
        <button onclick="goToChapters()" class="text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50" style="color:var(--deep)">&larr; Chapters</button>
        <div class="flex gap-3 text-xs font-semibold efp-scoreline">
          <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-gray-100" id="score-total">Total: ${state.score.attempted}/${chapterQCount(sections)}</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-green-100 text-green-700" id="score-correct">Correct: ${state.score.correct}</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-red-100 text-red-700" id="score-wrong">Wrong: ${state.score.wrong}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl text-white p-4 mb-4" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--deep),var(--deep2))">
        <div class="text-xs opacity-75 mb-1">${chapterNum(state.chapterName)}. Computer</div>
        <h2 class="font-bold text-lg">${textHTML(chapterDisplayName(state.chapterName))}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Your answers are saved on this device</span>
        <div class="flex gap-2"><button class="efp-soft-action" onclick="goBookmarks()">☆ Bookmarks</button>
        <button class="efp-reset-btn" onclick="resetChapter()" title="Clear this chapter’s answers and restart">↻ Reset Chapter</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-2 mb-3 overflow-x-auto pb-2 px-1" style="scroll-snap-type:x proximity">
        ${sections.map((s,i)=>{
            const done=s.questions.every((q,qi)=>Object.hasOwn(storedAnswers,`${i}-${qi}`));
            return `<button onclick="switchSection(${i})" title="${textHTML(s.title.en).replaceAll('"','&quot;')}" aria-label="Section ${i+1}" class="section-pill flex-shrink-0 w-9 h-9 rounded-full border-2 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold cursor-pointer bg-white ${i===state.currentSection?'active':done?'done':'border-gray-300 text-gray-500'}" style="scroll-snap-align:center">${done&&i!==state.currentSection?'✓':i+1}</button>`;
        }).join('')}
      </div>
      <div class="text-center text-sm mb-4 px-2">
        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-100 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 mb-1">Section ${state.currentSection+1} of ${sections.length}</span>
        <div class="font-bold" style="color:var(--ink)">${textHTML(sec.title.en)}</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">${textHTML(sec.title.hi)}</div>
      </div>
      <div id="questions-container" class="space-y-5">${sec.questions.map((q,qi)=>renderQuestion(q,qi)).join('')}</div>
      <div class="flex justify-between mt-6 mb-10 gap-3">
        <button onclick="prevSection()" ${state.currentSection===0?'disabled':''} class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm ${state.currentSection===0?'bg-gray-200 text-gray-400 cursor-not-allowed':'bg-white border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50'}" style="color:var(--deep)">&larr; Prev Section</button>
        <button onclick="nextSection()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-sm text-white" style="background:var(--gold)">${state.currentSection===sections.length-1?'Finish Chapter':'Next Section'} &rarr;</button>
      </div>
    </div>`;
}
function renderQuestion(q,qi){
    const key=`${state.currentSection}-${qi}`;
    if(!state.shuffleMap[key]){
        const order=q.o.map((_,i)=>i);
        for(let i=order.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[order[i],order[j]]=[order[j],order[i]];}
        state.shuffleMap[key]=order;
    }
    const order=state.shuffleMap[key], answered=Object.hasOwn(storedAnswers,key), prev=storedAnswers[key], correctOrigIdx=calcAnswerIndex(q);
    const fig=(VISUALS[String(chapterNum(state.chapterName))]||{})[String(q.num)];
    const bkey=activeBookmarkKey(q),saved=!!bookmarks[bkey];
    return `
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-200 p-4" id="q-${qi}" data-question-number="${q.num}">
      <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2">
        <p class="font-semibold text-sm mb-1 efp-question-copy" style="color:#2980b9">${qi+1}. ${textHTML(q.q.en)}</p>
        <button onclick="toggleBookmark(${qi})" class="efp-bookmark-btn" aria-label="${saved?'Remove bookmark':'Bookmark question'}" aria-pressed="${saved}" title="${saved?'Remove bookmark':'Save this question'}">${saved?'★':'☆'}</button>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm mb-3 efp-question-copy" style="color:#27ae60">${textHTML(q.q.hi)}</p>
      ${fig?`<div class="original-figure">${fig}</div>`:''}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2" id="opts-${qi}">
        ${order.map((origIdx,displayIdx)=>`
           <button onclick="selectOption(${qi},${displayIdx})" data-qi="${qi}" data-oi="${displayIdx}" ${answered?'disabled':''}
              class="option-btn text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border-2 border-gray-200 text-sm hover:border-gray-400 ${answered?'answered':''} ${answered&&origIdx===correctOrigIdx?'correct':''} ${answered&&origIdx===prev&&origIdx!==correctOrigIdx?'incorrect':''}">
              <span class="block option-en efp-question-copy">${textHTML(q.o[origIdx].en)}</span>
              <span class="block text-xs text-gray-500 efp-question-copy">${textHTML(q.o[origIdx].hi)}</span>
           </button>`).join('')}
      </div>
      <div id="exp-${qi}" class="${answered?'':'hidden'} mt-3 p-3 rounded-lg text-sm" style="background:#e8f6f3;border-left:4px solid #2ecc71">
        <p class="efp-question-copy" style="color:#1a1f2e">${textHTML(q.exp.en)}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs efp-question-copy" style="color:#27ae60">${textHTML(q.exp.hi)}</p>
      </div>
    </div>`;
}
function selectOption(qi,displayIdx){
    if(state.screen!=='quiz')return;
    const sec=state.quizData[state.currentSection],q=sec?.questions[qi], key=`${state.currentSection}-${qi}`;
    if(!q||Object.hasOwn(storedAnswers,key))return;
    const order=state.shuffleMap[key];if(!Array.isArray(order)||displayIdx<0||displayIdx>=order.length)return;
    const origIndex=order[displayIdx];storedAnswers[key]=origIndex;
    updateComputedScore();saveProgress();
    const btns=document.querySelectorAll(`#opts-${qi} .option-btn`), correct=calcAnswerIndex(q);
    btns.forEach((btn,i)=>{
        btn.classList.add('answered');btn.disabled=true;
        if(order[i]===correct)btn.classList.add('correct');
        if(i===displayIdx&&origIndex!==correct)btn.classList.add('incorrect');
    });
    document.getElementById(`exp-${qi}`)?.classList.remove('hidden');
    updateScoreBar();
    const dot=document.querySelector(`.section-pill[aria-label="Section ${state.currentSection+1}"]`);
    if(dot&&sec.questions.every((_,i)=>Object.hasOwn(storedAnswers,`${state.currentSection}-${i}`)))dot.title=dot.title+' — Completed';
}
function updateScoreBar(){
    const t=document.getElementById('score-total'),c=document.getElementById('score-correct'),w=document.getElementById('score-wrong');
    if(t)t.textContent=`Total: ${state.score.attempted}/${chapterQCount(state.quizData)}`;
    if(c)c.textContent=`Correct: ${state.score.correct}`;
    if(w)w.textContent=`Wrong: ${state.score.wrong}`;
}
function toggleBookmark(qi){
    if(state.screen!=='quiz')return;
    const q=state.quizData[state.currentSection]?.questions[qi];if(!q)return;
    const key=activeBookmarkKey(q);if(bookmarks[key])delete bookmarks[key];else bookmarks[key]=true;
    saveLocal(BOOKMARK_KEY,bookmarks);
    const btn=document.querySelector(`#q-${qi} .efp-bookmark-btn`);
    if(btn){btn.textContent=bookmarks[key]?'★':'☆';btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(!!bookmarks[key]));btn.title=bookmarks[key]?'Remove bookmark':'Save this question';btn.setAttribute('aria-label',btn.title);}
}
function bookmarkEntries(){
    const rows=[];
    CHAPTERS.forEach((ch,ci)=>MASTER[SUBJECT][ch].forEach((sec,si)=>sec.questions.forEach((q,qi)=>{
        if(bookmarks[`${chapterCode(ch)}:${q.num}`])rows.push({ch,ci,si,qi,q});
    })));
    return rows;
}
function renderBookmarks(){
    const entries=bookmarkEntries();
    return `<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-6 fade-in">
      <button onclick="goToChapters()" class="mb-4 text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50" style="color:var(--deep)">&larr; Chapters</button>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3" style="color:var(--ink)">★ Saved Computer Questions</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-6">${entries.length} bookmarked questions across 14 chapters</p>
      <div class="space-y-5">${entries.length?entries.map((e)=>`
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow border border-gray-200 p-4">
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2">Chapter ${numOf(e.ch)} · Section ${e.si+1} · Question ${e.q.num}</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-sm mb-1 efp-question-copy" style="color:#2980b9">${textHTML(e.q.q.en)}</p>
          <p class="text-sm mb-3 efp-question-copy" style="color:#27ae60">${textHTML(e.q.q.hi)}</p>
          <button class="efp-soft-action" onclick="openBookmark(${e.ci},${e.si},${e.qi})">Open in Quiz &rarr;</button>
        </div>`).join(''):'<p class="text-sm text-gray-500">No saved questions yet. Tap ☆ beside a question to bookmark it.</p>'}
      </div></div>`;
}
function goBookmarks(){state.screen='bookmarks';render();window.scrollTo({top:0});}
function openBookmark(ci,si,qi){goToQuizByNumber(ci+1);switchSection(si);requestAnimationFrame(()=>document.getElementById(`q-${qi}`)?.scrollIntoView({block:'start'}));}
function switchSection(i){
    if(state.screen!=='quiz'||!Number.isInteger(i)||i<0||i>=state.quizData.length)return;
    state.currentSection=i;saveProgress();render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});
}
function prevSection(){if(state.screen==='quiz'&&state.currentSection>0)switchSection(state.currentSection-1);}
function nextSection(){
    if(state.screen!=='quiz')return;
    if(state.currentSection<state.quizData.length-1)switchSection(state.currentSection+1);
    else alert(`Chapter complete!\nScore: ${state.score.correct} correct / ${state.score.wrong} wrong out of ${state.score.attempted} attempted.`);
}
function resetChapter(){
    if(state.screen!=='quiz'||!state.chapterName)return;
    if(!confirm('Reset this chapter? All your answers and question order for this chapter will be cleared. Bookmarks will stay saved.'))return;
    try {localStorage.removeItem(keyOf(state.chapterName));}catch(_){}
    loadProgress(state.chapterName);render();window.scrollTo({top:0});
}
function goHome(){state.screen='home';state.subject=null;state.chapterName=null;state.quizData=null;render();window.scrollTo({top:0});}
function goToChapters(){state.screen='chapters';state.subject=SUBJECT;state.chapterName=null;state.quizData=null;render();window.scrollTo({top:0});}
function goToQuizByNumber(n){
    const ch=CHAPTERS[n-1];if(!ch)return;
    state.screen='quiz';state.subject=SUBJECT;state.chapterName=ch;state.quizData=MASTER[SUBJECT][ch];
    loadProgress(ch);saveLocal(LAST_KEY,ch);render();window.scrollTo({top:0});
}
function goToQuiz(chapterName){const i=CHAPTERS.indexOf(chapterName);if(i!==-1)goToQuizByNumber(i+1);}
function render(){
    const app=document.getElementById('app');
    if(state.screen==='home')app.innerHTML=renderHome();
    else if(state.screen==='chapters')app.innerHTML=renderChapters();
    else if(state.screen==='quiz')app.innerHTML=renderQuiz();
    else if(state.screen==='bookmarks')app.innerHTML=renderBookmarks();
}
// Safe local fallback for offline preview; site's black-mode.js remains the authority online.
try{if(localStorage.getItem('efp_black_mode')==='on')document.documentElement.classList.add('efp-local-dark');}catch(_){}
render();

</script>
<script src="../search-logic.js?v=20260904v8"></script>
<!-- Computer quiz enhancements (progress, bookmarks, reset) are embedded above. -->
</body>
</html>
